<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Southern Life lifts half yr shr, dividend.</title>
<headline>Southern Life lifts half yr shr, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended September 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		     108.0   vs   87.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     72.0    vs   58.0</p>
<p>    Total income		  2.96    vs   2.51</p>
<p>    Net premium income	  2.08    vs   1.83</p>
<p>    Net investment revenue    0.88    vs   0.68</p>
<p>Taxed surplus attributable to shareholders</p>
<p>					0.20    vs   0.16</p>
<p>Div payable January 10</p>
<p>On register December 7</p>
<p>Full name: Southern Life Association Ltd (financial-</p>
<p>insurance)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
